<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
	 <TargetFrameworks>$(DefaultTargetFrameworks);$(CompatibilityTargetFrameworks)</TargetFrameworks>
	<IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
	<IncludeSource>true</IncludeSource>
	<GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
	<LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
	<PropertyGroup>
		<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
		<Title>Countries.World.NET</Title>
		<Description>A simple package designed to retrieve a list of all countries.
Fetch specific details about a country using its identifier.</Description>
		<PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/selfmadecode/world.net</PackageProjectUrl>
		<PackageIcon>globe.png</PackageIcon>
		<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/selfmadecode/world.net</RepositoryUrl>
		<PackageTags>countries;states;regions;provinces;territories;iso;iso3166;iso3166-1;iso3166-2;geography;location;data;dataset;global;international;world</PackageTags>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>v1.2.0

Updates
Updated country data for Kazakhstan, Ethiopia, Norway, and Equatorial Guinea to reflect the latest 
changes.
Corrected Kazakhstan's capital, native name, and region codes, and added three missing regions.
Added the South West Ethiopia Peoples' Region.
Corrected Norway's county codes to match ISO 3166-2.
Updated Equatorial Guinea's capital to Ciudad de la Paz.
Breaking Changes
Kazakhstan's region codes have changed to the current ISO 3166-2 codes. Applications relying on the previous codes must be updated.

Bug Fixes
Fixed outdated country and region information.
Corrected Kazakhstan's native name encoding.
Updated unit tests to reflect the changes.
Deprecations
N/A</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE</PackageLicenseFile>
		<Authors>selfmade</Authors>
		<PackageId>Countries.World.Net</PackageId>
		<Copyright>© 2025 SelfMadeCode. All rights reserved.</Copyright>
		<Version>1.1.0</Version>
	</PropertyGroup>
	<ItemGroup>
	  <None Include="..\..\LICENSE">
	    <Pack>True</Pack>
	    <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
	  </None>
	  <None Include="..\..\README.md">
	    <Pack>True</Pack>
	    <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
	  </None>
	  <None Include="..\globe.png">
	    <Pack>True</Pack>
	    <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
	  </None>
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>
